# Closed forms with symbolic bounds, finite ranges, steps and lists.
sum(i^2, i = 1 to n)
sum(i^3, i = 1 to n)
sum(k, k = 5 to n)
sum(a*k + b, k = 1 to n)
factor(sum(k, k = 1 to n))
sum(2^i, i = 0 to 5)
sum(i, i = 1 to 10 step 2)
sum(i, i = 1 to 0)
sum([1, 2, 3])
seq(i^2, i = 1 to 5)
seq(i^2, i = 1 to 5 step 2)
length([1, 2, 3])
